VALUE: 0.0
QUESTION: Y_Force
VALUE: 0.0
QUESTION: Z_Force
VALUE: 0.0
TITLE: Parameters
QUESTION: Function#CB#(Sine/Cosine_Load,Table)
VALUE: Sine/Cosine_Load
DEPENDENCIES: (Table,HIDE,Circular_Freq,#CURRENT#,HIDE,Phase_angle,#CURRENT#,HIDE,Initial_Time,#CURRENT#,HIDE,Final_Time,#CURRENT#,RESTORE,Load_Table,#CURRENT#)
DEPENDENCIES: (Sine/Cosine_Load,RESTORE,Circular_Freq,#CURRENT#,RESTORE,Phase_angle,#CURRENT#,RESTORE,Initial_Time,#CURRENT#,RESTORE,Final_Time,#CURRENT#,HIDE,Load_Table,#CURRENT#)
QUESTION: Circular_Freq
VALUE: 3.1416
HELP: Indicate the circular frequency of the dynamic load
QUESTION: Phase_angle
VALUE: 0.0
HELP: Indicate the phase angle of the dynamic load
QUESTION: Initial_Time
VALUE: 0.0
HELP: Indicate the initial time instant of aplication of the dynamic load
QUESTION: Final_Time
VALUE: 0.0
HELP: Indicate the final time instant of aplication of the dynamic load
QUESTION: Load_Table:#MAT#(Tables)
VALUE: Table
TKWIDGET: button_tables::initbutton
END CONDITION
